WEBVTT

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.570
Mobius the Frost Monarch 
attacks Power Dart Striker!

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.830
Ice Lance!

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.510
Incredible!

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.180
Sawatari, your card is too powerful!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.970
You're wrong.  It's not the 
monster that's too powerful.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.390
The one who's too powerful is...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.080
Sawatari!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.860
Oh yes!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.990
A duelist's skills are important.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:55.000
Calculated strategies, precise decision 
making, tough spirit and blessed with good looks!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:56.870
The one who has it all is...

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.250
Sawatari!

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.210
Yes!  Yes!

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:07.010
The perfect duelist who's expected 
to win and does win is...

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.680
Sawatari!

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.850
That's right!

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:14.990
But now that I acquired this 
new card, call me Neo Sawatari.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:16.460
Neo!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.200
Sawatari!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.900
Okay okay!  Ladies and gentlemen-

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.650
He's been influenced by...

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.650
...Yuya Sakaki.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.600
Don't say that name!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.070
The answer is...

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:31.940
Zero!

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:38.280
I lost because he had better cards than me!

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:42.110
I was unlucky because I didn't 
have any Pendulum Cards!

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.540
You've changed your story!

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.320
You did have Pendulum Cards because you 
tricked and stole them from Yuya Sakaki!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:55.020
I'll do anything it takes 
to defeat Yuya Sakaki!

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:57.030
Wash your neck and wait!
(Note: Japanese expression for "Just you wait!")

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.270
This feels good!

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.050
I'm getting shivers!

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.910
It's nice to wash off after 
sweating from dueling.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:07.820
Yuya, the back of your neck is dirty.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.110
Wash your neck.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.020
Okay okay.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.570
You only need to say “okay” once!

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:19.180
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:27.360
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.360
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:50.140
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.550
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.290
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:06.860
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.060
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:14.270
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:25.030
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.950
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:35.890
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:39.290
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:49.570
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.910
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:02.950
Revolution of Wrath
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.700
Sheesh!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.170
If they want to eat ice cream, 
they should go buy it themselves!

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.510
Ice!

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.590
You're complaining, but you bought a lot.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.950
You're so nice, Yuzu!

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.110
Yuzu?

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.780
Sawatari is too fired up.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:36.990
He's willing to do whatever 
it takes to crush Yuya Sakaki.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:43.670
He's the type who would be cruel 
and attack Yuya's weak points.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.030
C'mon, let's go.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.430
He gets more self-centered when he's hungry.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.590
Sawatari!

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.590
Yuzu!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.990
Sawatari, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.110
You're late!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:12.850
I'm sorry!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:17.510
I bought sweet milk, apple 
berry pie and melted honey.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:22.590
Yuzu, I think we should go tell Yuya.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:28.270
In the previous duel, Yuya 
gave it his all to save me.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.790
It's my turn to protect Yuya.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:35.270
Ayu, go back to school.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.350
But...

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.670
Why are you here?

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.970
You coward!

00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:01.210
I won't let you do whatever 
you want to defeat Yuya!

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:04.110
Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.510
Why are you here?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.950
I don't need to explain to you!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.350
There's a pie crumb on your mouth!

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:10.950
What?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.190
Sawatari, here.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.670
Yuzu Hiiragi, you fell right into our hands-

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.260
Duel me!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.430
You've leapt into the fire-

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.790
I'm going to pummel you!

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.970
The goddess of victory smiles upon me-

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.830
What's wrong?  Are you afraid to lose to me?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.930
Let me talk!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.470
I don't need to listen to you!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.410
You coward!  You loser!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.380
You second-rate duelist!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.070
Second-rate?

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.760
No, you're less than that!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.590
Third-rate!  Fourth-rate!

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.530
Hundredth-rate duelist!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.690
How dare you say that!

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:06.570
You still have time to take back those words.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:12.310
I don't feel like doing that, you 
coward loser hundredth-rate duelist!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.280
You don't know your place!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.470
I'll make you regret that!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.500
Who are you?

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.610
Stay back.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.240
Who are you?

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:51.880
Are you a knight who suddenly 
arrives to rescue the princess?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.560
That's a unique Duel Disk.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.660
You don't feel like answering my questions?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.330
Hey, who are you?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.040
Don't interfere!

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.330
This is my duel!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:17.080
I don't want to hurt you anymore.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.560
You're so cool.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.700
But that's enough, Mr. Knight.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.290
You're going to embarrass yourself.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:31.500
You're perfect for testing my new deck.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.960
I'll crush you.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:39.610
Duel!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.670
I'll go first.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.560
Fine, Mr. Knight.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:49.270
I set all five cards in my hand.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.160
I end my turn.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.900
You show up acting cool, 
but that's all you can do?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.530
Sawatari, use Heavy Storm!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.360
You don't have a single monster?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.360
Too bad, but luck isn't on your side.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.900
Didn't you hear me?

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.470
I ended my turn.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.990
Yuya!

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.330
Watch out!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.550
Whoa!

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.590
Are you okay?

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.440
Yuya!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.440
The ice cream is melted.

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:39.840
What a waste.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:42.990
Ayu, what happened?  Where's Yuzu?

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:48.130
Yuzu is...  Yuzu is in trouble!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.470
I'll show you my perfect dueling.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.930
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:04.070
I'll take advantage of your set cards.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:13.490
When you have at least two cards in your Spell & Trap 
Card Zone, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:16.990
Come out, Escher the Frost Vassal!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:22.490
Then I tribute Escher to Tribute Summon!

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:29.110
Mobius the Frost Monarch!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.540
All right!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.490
He already summoned a monster 
with 2400 attack points!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:37.540
Mobius's effect activates!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:45.090
When it's successfully Tribute Summoned, I can select up 
to two spell and trap cards on the field and destroy them!

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.060
Freeze Burst!

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.790
I'm only getting started!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.940
I activate the spell card 
Tribute Carnival from my hand!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:03.990
When I successfully Tribute Summon, 
this card lets me Tribute Summon again!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:10.940
He's going to tribute Mobius with 2400 
attack points to Tribute Summon again?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.540
Exactly.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:17.460
I tribute Mobius the Frost 
Monarch to Tribute Summon!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.770
Come out, Mobius the Mega Monarch!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:35.170
I would usually need to tribute two monsters.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:41.540
But if my monster was already Tribute Summoned, 
then I can Tribute Summon using only one monster!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.520
That's Mobius the Mega Monarch!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.390
Cool!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.090
Mobius the Mega Monarch's effect activates!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:56.590
When it's successfully Tribute Summoned, I can select up 
to three spell and trap cards on the field and destroy them!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:03.540
Mr. Knight, maybe you should use 
those cards before they're destroyed.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:04.840
That's pointless.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:11.910
Since I tributed a Water Attribute monster to summon Mobius 
the Mega Monarch, he can't activate cards that will destroy it.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:16.150
Freeze and break into pieces!  
Blizzard Destruction!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:27.030
Why did I feel the wind when 
there's no Action Field?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:48.640
All your set cards are destroyed, 
and you have no cards in your hand.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.890
And you have no monsters to defend with.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.740
You acted cool when you showed 
up, but you're pathetic.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.440
Pull yourself together!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.230
Maybe you shouldn't have 
interfered and let me handle it-

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:12.140
Mr. Knight dressed in black, 
you're an eyesore.  So leave.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:19.280
Let's battle!  Mobius the Mega 
Monarch attacks you directly!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:34.290
I activate the spell card The Phantom 
Knights of Shadow Veil from my graveyard.

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.340
From the graveyard?

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.940
A spell card?

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:41.100
You're activating a spell 
card from the graveyard?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.490
When you attack me directly...

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:50.440
I can treat this card as a monster and Special 
Summon as many copies as possible from the graveyard.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:14:03.290
Since an effect Special Summoned these cards, 
they're banished if they're sent to the graveyard.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.790
He instantly has three monsters on his field.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:11.200
You set those cards because you were already 
planning to Special Summon them as monsters?

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:16.440
You just summoned those monsters because 
you had nothing to defend with.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.000
I'll get rid of them.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:20.840
Go, Mobius the Mega Monarch!

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.780
Attack Shadow Veil!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:25.610
Imperial Charge!

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:33.840
When Shadow Veil is destroyed and 
sent to the graveyard, it's banished.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:38.290
You're barely surviving.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.590
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.800
I'll let you live until my next turn.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.740
Neo Sawatari, you're the best!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.440
You won't have a next turn.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.670
What?

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.790
My turn.  I draw!

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:07.290
I thought your dueling would put up some resistance, but 
there's no sharpness in your blade or power in your bullet.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:09.860
Not even a little bit.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.820
What?

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.710
What is he saying?

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.340
My stomach hurts!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.640
Even your clothes are a joke!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.590
I've achieved the requirements.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:25.690
When I have monsters with the same 
Level, my deck shows its true worth.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:32.540
With these two Level 4 Shadow Veils, 
I build the Overlay Network!

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:36.690
It can't be!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:37.740
That's...

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:45.260
From the black darkness, the fangs of rebellion 
that fight against the powers of stupidity descend!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.340
Xyz Summon!

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:52.740
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:58.140
Xyz Summon?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:02.340
Incredible.  He summoned a 
monster from his Extra Deck.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:05.290
He's a Xyz user?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.540
Is this for real?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:12.380
Xyz Summoning is a curriculum that 
only LDS's elite top class can take!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:22.740
I was slightly surprised when 
you suddenly Xyz Summoned.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:28.160
But are you planning to battle 
my Mobius with that monster?

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:32.640
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon 
has 2500 attack points.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.340
Mobius has 2800 attack points.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:43.490
Your Xyz Summon is nothing more than a bluff.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:52.440
An Xyz Monster's true power is to use its Overlay 
Units that represent its soul to destroy the opponent.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.440
I don't need a lecture about Xyz.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.000
I'm not interested.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.840
Then you'll learn about it physically.

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:03.970
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:13.180
By using one Overlay Unit, your Level 5-or-above 
monster's attack points are halved until the end of this turn.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:19.290
And Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon gains 
that amount of attack points!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.140
Treason Discharge!

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:25.690
Dark Rebellion's attack points...

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.260
...are now greater than Mobius's!

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:30.490
This must be a joke!

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.810
I'm not done.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:38.270
I use the remaining Overlay Unit to activate 
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.040
So the same thing is going to happen again?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.740
This is bad!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:45.290
Treason Discharge!

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:52.390
4600 attack points!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.920
No way!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.390
Let's battle!

00:17:57.640 --> 00:18:02.890
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks 
Mobius the Mega Monarch!

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:07.290
Go!  Destroy the glacier with your fangs!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:12.170
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.290
What's happening?

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.940
It's not an Action Field, 
but I felt an impact!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:48.140
His monster's power blew us away?

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.680
This is bad.

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:56.840
I'll only ask once.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.840
Prepare to answer.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.590
This badge is from LDS, correct?

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.540
What's your connection to Academia?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.690
Academia?  What do you mean?

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:10.840
Stop playing dumb!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:16.290
I'm serious!  Anyone who 
enrolls in LDS has that badge!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:20.690
I don't know about Academia!  
That's the truth!

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:23.390
Then I'm done with you.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:28.840
You fool!  The duel isn't over yet!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:32.090
I activate the trap Ice Rage!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:44.140
When your monster destroys my Water-Type monster in battle, this card 
destroys your monster, and you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:53.890
Your Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon is destroyed, 
and yout take 4600 points of damage!

00:19:55.240 --> 00:20:00.790
I anticipated what you would do, so 
I set a trap card in advance.  I win!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:04.090
That's a lame strategy.  Child's play.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.420
What?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:10.190
I activate the Continuous Spell Phantom 
Knights' Spear from my graveyard.

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:19.740
When your trap card activates, I banish this card from the 
graveyard to negate your trap card's activation and destroy it.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:26.370
And you take 100 points of damage!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:32.790
Wait wait wait!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:37.440
Feel the battlefield's sadness and pain!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.640
Yuya?

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.090
It was you?

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.040
Sawatari!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.190
This guy is dangerous!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.560
Let's get outta here!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.890
Yuya, why are you dressed like that?

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.640
What's this?

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.790
What?

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:37.340
Yuya?

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.190
Yuzu!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.540
Yuya?

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:43.440
Are you okay?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.950
Yuya...  You're Yuya, right?

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.420
What are you talking about, Yuzu?

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:54.630
That wasn't Yuya?

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:01.300
It smells like smoke in here.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:02.740
Did you build a bonfire?

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:04.990
It stinks!

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:19.010
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:28.490
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:40.500
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:45.740
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:51.180
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.440
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:02.040
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:06.460
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:12.430
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:17.840
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:23.140
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:32.480
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:40.730
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:48.970
I saw him with my own eyes!

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:52.140
The culprit was definitely Yuya Sakaki!

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:54.790
There's no way Yuya would do that!

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:57.740
Was Yuya really responsible for yesterday?

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.020
A duel isn't a tool for fighting!

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:05.420
But I don't want anyone else to take 
You Show School or Pendulum Summoning!

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:11.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
You Show School in Danger!!  LDS Invades

00:24:11.440 --> 00:24:13.790
The fun is only getting started!
